      "role": "user",
      "content": "my daughter is 6 and she has a really scary fever, like 104.2. she's also breathing really fast and making this weird whistling sound when she breathes. she weighs about 60 lbs. i have the liquid acetaminophen (160mg/5ml) here. how much should i give her right now to get this fever down? she's acting so weird and i'm panicking.",
